# UML sequence diagram: ordered messages, self-call, replies, alt fragment with two operands.
diagram sequence
node n1 actor "User" @30,20,130,90
node n2 participant "Web App" @260,30,420,80
node n3 participant "Auth Service" @540,30,720,80
node n4 database "User DB" @840,20,960,90
edge n1 n2 "enter credentials"
edge n2 n3 "login(user, pwd)"
edge n3 n4 "findUser(user)"
edge n4 n3 reply "user record"
edge n3 n3 "verifyPassword()"
edge n3 n2 reply "token"
edge n2 n1 reply "dashboard"
edge n3 n2 reply "401 Unauthorized"
edge n2 n1 reply "error message"
group g1 alt @200,560,780,960
group g2 operand "[valid]" parent=g1 : e6 e7
group g3 operand "[invalid]" parent=g1 : e8 e9
